    '_**What the files do not contain, and what a successor will need in the first month.** That the Nassar olive loan is performing because the officer visits the press every eight weeks and the arrears stop the week after each visit. **That is a judgement, not a fact, and it is in nobody\'s file.**_',
    '_That the Haddad co-operative\'s figures are reliable but its treasurer is not, so every statement is checked against the delivery notes. **That the Barakat file looks worse than it is: two deferred instalments in 2024 were a bank error, corrected, and the correction never reached the credit history.**_',
    '_That three borrowers in one village are brothers who guarantee each other and would default together. **Their files are separate, their surnames differ, and only the officer knows.**_',
    '_**The handover note is therefore not a summary of the portfolio.** It is a list of the judgements the portfolio is currently running on, with the evidence for each and a note of whether the successor should keep them._',
