    '**Judgement 1, and the most important thing on this page.** **Three borrowers in Khirbet — files 0441, 0518 and 0702 — are brothers. Different surnames, separate files, no recorded connection.** They guarantee each other informally and **in my judgement they would default together.** Total exposure 9,400,000. **This has been in nothing but my head for four years. That is a failure of mine, not a piece of value I am passing on, and the first thing I would do in your position is get it recorded properly.**',
